<title>GERMANY: Argentina's Menem to visit Germany May 26-28.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Menem to visit Germany May 26-28.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine President Carlos Menem will pay a state visit to Germany from May 26 to 28 and stay in both Berlin and Bonn, the German government said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Bonn did not give any further details about Menem's visit.</p>
